flowchart TD
  call["handler.handle"] --> threw{"Exception?"}
  threw -->|no| flag{"return value"}
  flag -->|true| ok["this handler succeeded"]
  flag -->|false| bad["combined result is false, no retry"]
  threw -->|yes| logged["error log, Tracy if Debugger is enabled"]
  logged --> methods{"canRetry and maxRetry both exist?"}
  methods -->|no| stop["no new message"]
  methods -->|yes| room{"retries less than maxRetry?"}
  room -->|no| stop
  room -->|yes| copy["send a copy with executeAt set"]
